<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">
    <text class="eyebrow">任课老师薪资</text>
    <text class="h1">我的总薪资</text>
    <text class="muted">老师端仅展示本人月度总薪资，逐课时核算和薪资拆分由财务端留存。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="grid">
      <view class="metric">
        <text class="muted">本月总薪资</text>
        <text class="value">{{netPay}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中...</view>
  <view wx:else class="card">
    <text class="card-title">展示口径</text>
    <text class="muted">当前页面只展示月度薪资汇总。逐节课和薪资项目的核算仅在财务端查看。</text>
  </view>
</view>
